{"id":780,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Drampa is a kind and friendly Pokémon—up until it’s angered. When that happens, it stirs up a gale and flattens everything around."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"The mountains it calls home are nearly two miles in height. On rare occasions, it descends to play with the children living in the towns below."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It appears in towns and plays with the children. Drampa will protect kids when they’re in danger, so their moms don’t have to worry."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"If a child it has made friends with is bullied, Drampa will find the bully’s house and burn it to the ground."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon is friendly to people and loves children most of all. It comes from deep in the mountains to play with children it likes in town."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It has a compassionate personality, but if it is angered, it completely destroys its surroundings with its intense breath."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Berserk","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Sp. Atk stat when it takes a hit that causes its HP to drop to half or less."},{"name":"Sap Sipper","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon takes no damage when hit by Grass-type moves. Instead, its Attack stat is boosted."},{"name":"Cloud Nine","hidden":true,"description":"Eliminates the effects of weather."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"White","shape":"Squiggle","evolution":{"id":780,"name":"Drampa","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,497],[1,589],[5,239],[10,182],[15,137],[20,219],[25,225],[30,326],[35,406],[40,113],[45,19],[50,304],[55,200]],"machine":[133,213,59,784,523,347,337,349,406,89,203,412,263,126,53,374,19,411,416,447,257,270,542,56,63,304,58,196,113,200,583,182,240,156,157,496,219,247,421,214,555,173,76,211,707,164,241,276,57,129,87,86,85,253,526],"egg":[407,54,